## Implementation Guidelines

### Priority Order
1. Layout structure and basic panels
2. Panel visibility controls
3. Responsive behavior
4. Resize functionality

### Testing Scenarios
- Desktop (various screen sizes)
- Tablet (portrait and landscape)
- Mobile devices
- Different panel combinations
- Keyboard navigation
- Screen readers

### Performance Considerations
- Minimize layout shifts
- Optimize transitions
- Lazy load panel content
- Use will-change for animations

## Integration Points

### Theme System
- Ensure panels respect theme variables
- Implement proper dark/light mode support
- Use consistent border and shadow styles

### Chat System
- Right panel should integrate with chat system
- Support different chat panel modes
- Handle chat state persistence

### Navigation
- Left panel should integrate with site navigation
- Support nested navigation items
- Highlight active routes

## Accessibility Requirements
- All panels must be keyboard navigable
- Use proper ARIA attributes for dynamic content
- Ensure sufficient color contrast
- Implement focus management
- Support screen readers 